---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Staircase from '../components/Staircase.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About — Nodir Fayzullayev"
  description="About Nodir Fayzullayev, a data analyst in Tashkent working across SQL Server, Power BI, Python, 1C ERP, and internal tools."
  path="/about/"
>
  <header class="intro">
    <p class="label">About</p>
    <h1 class="claim">From an unclear operational problem to a system people can use.</h1>
    <p class="prose lead">
      I&rsquo;m a data analyst in Tashkent and the first data hire at Pentazone, a
      seven-branch family entertainment company. I own the chain from 1C extraction and
      SQL Server modelling to Power BI, Python reporting, and internal applications.
    </p>
  </header>

  <section>
    <h2 class="label">How I work</h2>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        I&rsquo;m most useful when the problem is real but the specification is not.
        I interview the people doing the work, quantify where the process fails, and
        turn that understanding into a model, report, automation, or application.
      </p>
      <p>
        At Pentazone, that approach helped connect a company-wide systems analysis to
        the platform built from it: 1,327 maintenance requests and 747 audit comments
        were classified, 11 systemic failures were traced to three root causes, and the
        resulting workflow now supports around 20 staff.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="label">Skills</h2>
    <Staircase
      layers={{
        store: 'SQL Server · T-SQL · 1C ERP',
        move: 'Python · pandas · SQLAlchemy',
        read: 'Power BI · DAX · Excel',
        write: 'Next.js · React · PySide6',
      }}
    />
    <p class="prose note">
      Also: dimensional modelling, star schemas, ETL, row-level security, openpyxl,
      ReportLab, python-telegram-bot, and Git.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="label">Education</h2>
    <div class="records">
      <article>
        <h3 class="title">Data Analytics · MAAB Academy</h3>
        <p class="summary">Seven-month programme, graduated · Tashkent</p>
        <p class="meta">2024 — 2025</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3 class="title">Finance and Financial Technologies</h3>
        <p class="summary">Part-time · Qarshi State Technical University</p>
        <p class="meta">2022 — 2024</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3 class="title">Microsoft PL-300 · Power BI Data Analyst</h3>
        <p class="summary">In progress</p>
        <p class="meta">Expected November 2026</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="label">Languages</h2>
    <p class="prose">Uzbek · native &nbsp;&nbsp; Russian · professional &nbsp;&nbsp; English · professional</p>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .intro .label,
  section > .label { margin-bottom: 0.9rem; }
  .intro .claim { margin-bottom: 1.15rem; }
  .lead { font-size: var(--t-summary); }
  section { margin-top: var(--gap-section); }
  .note { margin-top: 1.1rem; }
  .records {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
  }
  .records .title { margin-bottom: 0.15rem; }
  .summary {
    color: var(--slate);
    font-size: var(--t-summary);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }
  .meta {
    color: var(--slate);
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: var(--t-meta);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
</style>
